+---
+id: dl-003-long-rental-discount-threshold-rounding-scope
+type: decision-log
+title: "Long-rental discount: threshold, rounding, scope"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+<!-- decision-log body. `wingfoil memory add` copies this scaffold, setting only `id`, `title` and
+     `status` (and any `--tags` or `--set` value). Fill the required frontmatter fields and replace
+     these placeholder comments yourself; `wingfoil memory submit` then checks the required fields,
+     moves `status` forward and commits the document as you left it, naming in the commit body the
+     content it carries. -->
+
+## Context
+
+Rentals of 3 days or more must cost 10% less than full price, in quotes and bookings. The request does
+not say how a fractional cent is handled, nor whether the discount covers the whole period.
+
+## Decision
+
+- The threshold is 3 whole days (`end - start >= 3 days`); shorter rentals keep the full price.
+- The discount applies to the whole total, computed in integer arithmetic as `total * 90 / 100` and
+  rounded to the nearest cent (`Math.round`, halves up), so the total stays an integer number of cents.
+- The discount lives in the shared pricing step, so `quote` and `book` always agree.
+
+## Consequences
+
+Prices of rentals of 3 days or more change: 3 days at 2500 cents/day now costs 6750 instead of 7500.
+Rounding differs from the exact 10% by at most half a cent.
